E5%A5%88%E6%B4%9B%E6%AF%94"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93512387"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3870"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159150829","name":"蒙巴萨","country":"KEN","lat":-4.03808,"lon":39.68797,"kind":"city","region":"KE-300","rank":3,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"蒙巴萨 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"1587年，赞比西河流域的津巴王国兴起，随即北上攻占了基尔瓦、蒙巴萨，最终在马林迪城下被击退。\n蒙巴萨坐落于肯尼亚的沿海平原之上，城市中心位于蒙巴萨岛，岛屿南侧的和北侧的都铎河将其与大陆分离。\n气候变化与温室效应对蒙巴萨的影响十分明显，海岸侵蚀为城市建设带来许多困难，日渐上涨的海平面也增加了海啸洪水的频率。","culture":"蒙巴萨的具体建城时间已不可考，肯尼亚当地的历史教科书称蒙巴萨建于公元900年。\n12世纪，阿拉伯地理学家穆罕默德·伊德里西提到蒙巴萨是一座繁荣的贸易城镇。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q225641","articleTitle":"蒙巴萨","sourceRevision":91702108,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 蒙巴萨","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%92%99%E5%B7%B4%E8%90%A8"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91702108"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q225641"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159149759","name":"梅鲁","country":"KEN","lat":0.05998,"lon":37.64002,"kind":"city","region":"KE-400","rank":4,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159149761","name":"埃尔多雷特","country":"KEN","lat":0.52001,"lon":35.26998,"kind":"city","region":"KE-700","rank":4,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159148301","name":"马萨比特","country":"KEN","lat":2.33,"lon":37.98,"kind":"city","region":"KE-400","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159148303","name":"摩亚雷","country":"KEN","lat":3.51998,"lon":39.05001,"kind":"city","region":"KE-400","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"摩亚雷 · 地点概要","geo":"摩亚雷（Moyale）是位于埃塞俄比亚和肯亚边境的小镇，座标，大部分土地属于埃塞俄比亚奥罗米亚州，而小部分则属于肯亚领土。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1009179","articleTitle":"摩亞雷","sourceRevision":94502591,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 摩亚雷","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%91%A9%E4%BA%9E%E9%9B%B7"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94502591"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1009179"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148305","name":"纳库鲁","country":"KEN","lat":-0.28,"lon":36.06998,"kind":"city","region":"KE-700","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159148339","name":"拉穆镇","country":"KEN","lat":-2.26204,"lon":40.91967,"kind":"city","region":"KE-300","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"拉穆镇 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"拉穆镇（Lamu）是肯亚拉穆岛最大的城镇，而该岛属于拉穆群岛的众多岛屿之一。","culture":"其他传统出口商品包括象牙 、红树、龟板和犀牛角，通过印度洋运往中东和印度。\n考古学以及DNA测试证实了这个说法的真实性。","see":"拉穆有若干博物馆，其中包括拉穆博物馆——陈列有作仪式之用的角（称为锡瓦 ，siwa），其他博物馆都致力于展示斯瓦希里语文化，或者提供当地邮政服务。\n拉穆镇历史悠久，已列入联合国教科文组织世界遗产名录。\n老城区已作为“最古老，保存最完好的东非斯瓦希里定居点”列入世界遗产名录。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q272799","articleTitle":"拉穆镇","sourceRevision":94607352,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 拉穆镇","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8B%89%E7%A9%86%E9%95%87"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94607352"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q272799"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148341","name":"马林迪","country":"KEN","lat":-3.21,"lon":40.10002,"kind":"city","region":"KE-300","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"马林迪 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"马林迪，古称麻林地，为一个座落于非洲东岸肯尼亚加拉纳河河口，滨临印度洋的港湾都市，距肯亚第二大城市蒙巴萨约一百二十公里。","culture":"1498年，葡萄牙航海家达·伽马到达马林迪签署贸易协定，并在此找到著名海员伊本·马吉德，由其带领前往印度，继续其探索印度航线之路。\n1499年，葡萄牙人正式在此建立贸易商站，成为欧洲至印度航线的中途站。","see":"而当地亦有为数不少的旅游名胜如马林迪海洋国家公园及海边的度假屋等。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q271411","articleTitle":"馬林迪","sourceRevision":93173165,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 马林迪","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A6%AC%E6%9E%97%E8%BF%AA"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93173165"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q271411"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148343","name":"基苏木","country":"KEN","lat":-0.09004,"lon":34.75001,"kind":"city","region":"KE-600","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159136229","name":"姆溫基","country":"KEN","lat":-0.92957,"lon":38.07002,"kind":"city","region":"KE-400","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159136233","name":"恩布","country":"KEN","lat":-0.51957,"lon":37.45,"kind":"city","region":"KE-400","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159136239","name":"马查科斯","country":"KEN","lat":-1.50954,"lon":37.25999,"kind":"city","region":"KE-400","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"马查科斯 · 地点概要","geo":"马查科斯，肯尼亚城镇，位于首都内罗毕东南64公里。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q693093","articleTitle":"马查科斯","sourceRevision":76775852,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 马查科斯","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A9%AC%E6%9F%A5%E7%A7%91%E6%96%AF"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=76775852"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q693093"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159136243","name":"納紐基","country":"KEN","lat":0.0204,"lon":37.06,"kind":"city","